          <gmd:otherCitationDetails>
            <gco:CharacterString>Entity and Attribute Overview: The image service layer: NAIP Public Image Services contains the following fields and attributes - OBJECTID ( type: esriFieldTypeOID , alias: OBJECTID ) - standard ESRI attribute primary key Shape ( type: esriFieldTypeGeometry , alias: Shape ) - Standard ESRI geometry field Name ( type: esriFieldTypeString , alias: Name , length: 50 ) - Image name to include overview names at smaller scales and image names at larger scales Category ( type: esriFieldTypeInteger , alias: Category ) - Mosaic dataset category Year_ts ( type: esriFieldTypeSmallInteger , alias: Year_ts ) - Year of imagery ST ( type: esriFieldTypeString , alias: ST , length: 2 ) - State QQNAME ( type: esriFieldTypeString , alias: QQNAME , length: 10 ) - Quarter Quad Name QQDATE ( type: esriFieldTypeDate , alias: QQDATE , length: 8 ) - Quarter Quad Date iDate_ts ( type: esriFieldTypeDate , alias: iDate_ts , length: 8 ) - Majority date of Quarter Quad image Entity and Attribute Detail Citation: The attribute values were derived from information from the United States Department of Agriculture, Farm Production and Conservation Business Center, Geospatial Enterprise Operations (FPAC-BC-GEO) public image services.</gco:CharacterString>
          </gmd:otherCitationDetails>
